    "detailed_description": "Imagine a World Jigsaw Puzzle Championship that you can take part in from the comfort of your own home. Impossible? Now it's possible!<br><br>eSports Jigsaw Puzzles is an endless jigsaw puzzle competition in which any player can become the best in the world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic Gameplay Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Buying jigsaw puzzles<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/9dde0d9a3d26cb6b50ed2311e9b2d160.poster.avif?t=1669354482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/9dde0d9a3d26cb6b50ed2311e9b2d160.webm?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/9dde0d9a3d26cb6b50ed2311e9b2d160.mp4?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Watching another people's records<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/087c14733f18c39f37baefe58f0f3be4.poster.avif?t=1669354482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/087c14733f18c39f37baefe58f0f3be4.webm?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/087c14733f18c39f37baefe58f0f3be4.mp4?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Opening boxes with physics jigsaw puzzles<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/e89215d7bba3ae79e4b2e2cd4f68d6eb.poster.avif?t=1669354482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/e89215d7bba3ae79e4b2e2cd4f68d6eb.webm?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/e89215d7bba3ae79e4b2e2cd4f68d6eb.mp4?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Building and connecting segments like in real life!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/ed18ad9b3b6e44926403f537da86e1f2.poster.avif?t=1669354482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/ed18ad9b3b6e44926403f537da86e1f2.webm?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/ed18ad9b3b6e44926403f537da86e1f2.mp4?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Earning coins to unlock all puzzles in the library &amp; Breaking the records of solving time worldwide (by UTCNow timer)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/a338624ec5fa00f96b6300b04eea56fd.poster.avif?t=1669354482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/a338624ec5fa00f96b6300b04eea56fd.webm?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/a338624ec5fa00f96b6300b04eea56fd.mp4?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Crossplay with mobile platform<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/ddd8abae3a280930ecf22134c12bb596.poster.avif?t=1669354482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/ddd8abae3a280930ecf22134c12bb596.webm?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2217780/extras/ddd8abae3a280930ecf22134c12bb596.mp4?t=1669354482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Other Gameplay Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Registration and login by Nickname<br></li><li> Solving jigsaw puzzles in 2D or 3D<br></li><li> Physics pieces with realistic shapes</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upcoming Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Game Worlds Library<br></li><li> Tables Library<br></li><li> Avatars Library<br></li><li> Every day rewards<br></li><li> Leaderboard<br></li><li> More options by number of pieces<br></li><li> Collaborative big jigsaw puzzle solving<br></li><li> Online &amp; Offline tournaments!</li></ul>",
